---
title: Mods - Vintage Story Wiki
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ lang }}/mods/index.html"
---
<h1>Mods</h1>
<p>This wiki was generated from vanilla game data plus the following installed mods.</p>
<p class="muted">Source: each mod's own <code>modinfo.json</code> (name/version/side/type/website/authors/description); the mod name links out to its mods.vintagestory.at listing when that's been cached by <code>npm run download</code> (re-run it to pick this up for mods downloaded before this existed).</p>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Mod</th><th>Version</th><th>Side</th><th>Type</th><th>Authors</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for mod in generated.mods %}
    <tr>
      <td>
        {% if mod.assetid %}<a href="https://mods.vintagestory.at/show/mod/{{ mod.assetid }}">{{ mod.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ mod.name }}{% endif %}
        <span class="tag">{{ mod.modid }}</span>
        {% if mod.website %}&middot; <a href="{{ mod.website }}">source</a>{% endif %}
      </td>
      <td>{{ mod.version }}</td>
      <td>{{ mod.side }}</td>
      <td>{% if mod.type %}<span class="tag">{{ mod.type }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td>{{ mod.authors | default([]) | join(", ") }}</td>
      <td>
        {% if mod.isVanilla %}<span class="muted">vanilla</span>{% endif %}
        {% if mod.hasCompiledCode %}<span class="warning">ships compiled code (.dll) &mdash; custom behavior not captured</span>{% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    {% if mod.description %}
    <tr>
      <td colspan="6"><span class="muted">{{ mod.description | lineBreaks | safe }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
